From: RDNA4 local integration
Subject: [PATCH 19] radv/darwin: report logical limits and bound fixed-function windows

Raise native logical buffer/allocation limits to the implemented 8 GiB ceiling
without changing UBO/SSBO descriptor limits. Reject oversized creates before
alignment, saturate hardware vertex/index windows, and exclude composite BOs
from the single-handle native transfer API.

Base: f5cb8ee032adabef599ae892ec4e42d796b84da9 + patches 0001..0018.

